+//! Authoritative notification permission queries.
+//!
+//! Tauri's desktop `permission_state()` unconditionally returns `Granted`, so
+//! it cannot detect a user who disabled rorca notifications in System
+//! Settings. On macOS this module queries `UNUserNotificationCenter` instead.
+//! Windows and Linux report a non-authoritative `unknown` until a real
+//! platform query is implemented for them.
